'''Sunneism''' is a [[wikipedia:Dualism_in_cosmology#Duotheism,_bitheism,_ditheism|bitheistic or duotheistic]] religion with adherents throughout [[Basis]].  

Sunneists believe that [[Basis]] was created by the [[Divine Couple]] of [[Sunne (god)|Sunne]]<!--Sun--> and [[Mōna (goddess)|Mōna]]<!--Moon-->, and that [[wikipedia:Human|humans]] are their servants. 

==Beliefs==
===Divine Couple===
{{Main|Divine Couple}}

Sunneist cosmology identifies two collaborating deities: [[Sunne (god)|Sunne]] and [[Mōna (goddess)|Mōna]], who represent a [[Divine Couple]]. 

===Gift of Basis===
The Sunneist creation myth states that "Basis is the home of [[wikipedia:human|humans]] and the [[Divine Couple]]'s gift to them, their children." U/C

===Role of Mankind===
The [[Book of Life]] describes humans as the Children of the Divine Couple.

